title: Lookalike/Homoglyph Sender Domain
id: b67fa69f-8bee-41f5-a9ed-d81c7ae24561
status: experimental
description: Detects inbound mail from domains that are visually similar to the organization or a trusted brand (character substitution, added hyphens, homoglyphs), a lookalike-domain phishing technique.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/002/
logsource:
  category: mail
detection:
  selection:
    sender_domain_lookalike: true
  condition: selection
fields:
  - sender
  - recipient
  - subject
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate similar-named partner domains
level: high
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1566.002
